          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 2,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Organizations are the top-level entities in Capgo. They allow you to group apps, team members, and resources under a single umbrella. Each organization can have multiple members with different roles and permissions."
        }
      ]
